WEBVTT

00:00:00.773 --> 00:00:02.313
<v><b>A:</b></v> <b>Is he</b> from France?

00:00:04.939 --> 00:00:06.072
<v><b>B:</b></v> Yes, <b>he is</b>.

00:00:08.014 --> 00:00:09.462
No, <b>he isn’t</b>.

00:00:13.823 --> 00:00:15.387
<v><b>A:</b></v> <b>Is she</b> from Poland?

00:00:17.802 --> 00:00:19.042
<v><b>B:</b></v> Yes, <b>she is</b>.

00:00:21.041 --> 00:00:22.241
No, <b>she isn’t</b>.

00:00:26.828 --> 00:00:27.741
<v><b>A:</b></v> <b>Is it</b> good?

00:00:30.218 --> 00:00:31.125
<v><b>B:</b></v> Yes, <b>it is</b>.

00:00:33.253 --> 00:00:34.319
No, <b>it isn’t</b>.